---

The `design/` skill pack is original writing for this repository. Its *approaches*
(brief inference + anti-slop gates, design command vocabulary, motion craft /
strict motion review) were studied from open design-skill ecosystems including:

- Taste Skill — https://www.tasteskill.dev/ · https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
- Impeccable — https://impeccable.style/ · https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable
- Emil Kowalski skills — https://emilkowal.ski/skill · https://github.com/emilkowalski/skill

Those projects remain separately licensed by their authors. Prefer installing them
directly when you need their exact upstream behavior; this pack is a complementary,
guardrails-integrated alternative and does not copy their skill file contents.

